---
import { base } from 'astro:config/client';
---
<section class="cta-band">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Beyond NEBU</span>
    <h2>The first expression of a larger urban model.</h2>
    <p class="lead">
      NEBU is designed to be repeated — Build → Connect → Operate → Learn → Scale. What is proven
      here becomes the pattern for future cities.
    </p>
    <p class="closing">
      "A smarter city is not a city with more technology. It is a city that understands itself,
      responds intelligently, and keeps improving."
    </p>
    <div class="cta-sep" aria-hidden="true"></div>
    <span class="eyebrow">Planning documents</span>
    <p class="lead">
      The full NEBU planning baseline and Project Charter are available to review and download.
    </p>
    <a class="btn btn-primary" href={`${base}/documents`}>View planning documents</a>
  </div>
</section>